    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, mango pulp, prepared sugar syrup and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Pour it into a bowl, add dry ginger powder and give it a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl, serve chilled with fried puri, idada, mango fajeto and dal ki sabji.",
      "In a saucepan, add water, sugar and let it cook for 5-6 minutes until sugar is cooked well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add remaining mango pulp, water, curd, salt to taste, turmeric powder, gram flour and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a handi, add oil, once it’s hot, add bay leaf, cinnamon stick, cloves, curry leaves, button chillies, small mustard seeds, cumin seeds and let it splutter well.",
      "Add prepared fajeto, jaggery and simmer it for 10-12 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Finish it with ginger and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with fried puri, idada, dal ki sabji and aamras.",
      "In a saucepot, add soaked yellow moong dal, water, salt to taste, turmeric powder and mix it well.",
      "Let it simmer for a while until the dal is cooked well.",
      "Strain the dal, transfer it to a bowl and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it’s hot, add a pinch of asafoetida, degi red chili powder, coriander powder, cooked dal and saute it for 4-5 minutes.",
      "Add fresh coriander leaves and give it a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with pomegranate pearls and coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with fried puri, idada, mango fajeto and aamras."
    ],
